SUMMARY:Beautify Bragtown: Stained Glass Suncatchers-CANCELED
DESCRIPTION:Arts and craft lovers are welcome join us in the afternoon at 
 Bragtown for an exciting for a relaxing and engaging crafting hour. Make an 
 original creation or put your own spin on one of our guided 
 projects!\n\nThis time we will be creating stained glass suncatchers! 
 Choose a premade template to color in and create beautiful window 
 decorations for your home!\n\nThe Beautify Bragtown Art Series will be held 
 as a monthly program which aims to provide community and recreation 
 activities to patrons of all backgrounds. Each month patrons and their 
 families are invited to come together and take on a new craft idea.  Staff 
 present will provide all templates\, instructions\, and craft materials as 
 well as provide any support we can. After completing their craft\, patrons 
 are welcome to take the craft home or have it showcased here at 
 Bragtown!\n\nMaterials are limited so register now to save your spot!.
LOCATION:Bragtown Branch Library (3200 Dearborn Dr)
ORGANIZER;CN="Felicia Nobles":MAILTO:flnobles@dconc.gov
