BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20261017T150000Z
DTEND:20261017T190000Z
DTSTAMP:20261017T000000Z
SUMMARY:Elevenses\, Coloring\, and The Two Towers
DESCRIPTION:Gather\, good folk\, and spend a fair and merry afternoon in 
 gentle cheer and quiet delight. Come partake of humble refreshments as you 
 lose yourselves in the noble artistry of Lord of the Rings coloring books\, 
 bringing to life the realms of Middle-earth with your own hand.\n\nWhilst 
 we color\, The Lord of the Rings: The Two Towers shall play before us in 
 its full extended glory\, a grand tale unfolding over approximately three 
 hours and fifty-five minutes. The film is rated PG-13.\n\nEach traveler who 
 joins our fellowship shall depart with their own Lord of the Rings coloring 
 book and a set of colored pencils\, so that the spirit of Middle-earth may 
 journey home with them.\n\nRegistration is required to secure your place in 
 this gathering.\n\nFor your presence\, you will earn an extra entry into 
 the One Walk to Rule Them All grand prize drawing with submission of a 
 completed tracker.\n\nThis program is made possible through the generosity 
 of the Friends of the Durham Library.
LOCATION:Adult Programming Room\, South Regional Library (4505 S. Alston Ave)
ORGANIZER;CN="Jessica L.":MAILTO:jllundin@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Arts & Crafts, Friends of the Durham Library, Movie, One Walk
UID:LibCal-14288-16306035
URL:https://durhamcountylibrary.libcal.com/event/16306035
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
