SUMMARY:Adult Story Time -- Ghost Stories
DESCRIPTION:Read-alouds are for grown-ups too! Join us for a weekday 
 evening adult story time at the North Regional Library. Spend an hour 
 listening to read-alouds from books and stories in the library collection. 
 Tea\, coffee\, and hot chocolate will be provided.\n\nOctober has arrived! 
 Time for some spooky stuff\, don't you think? This month we'll read from 
 the library's Big Book of Ghost Stories\, an anthology that calls itself 
 the most complete collection of uncanny\, spooky\, creepy tales ever 
 published.\n\nRegistration is appreciated but not required.\n\nE-mail Bob 
 with any questions: rskesler@dconc.gov
