SUMMARY:Ready\, Set\, Baby Class
DESCRIPTION:This free prenatal breastfeeding education class is designed to 
 help you get ready for your baby\, whether you are a first-time parent or 
 adding to your family. These classes are a great way to prepare for 
 pregnancy\, birth\, and life with a newborn. You’ll get helpful 
 information on breastfeeding\, postpartum care\, and what to expect in 
 those early weeks. Our class is packed with conversations\, resources\, and 
 a raffle prize at the end! Snacks will be provided. Registration required. 
 \n\nThis class will be offered on Thursday\, October 22nd from 11 am–1 pm 
 in Spanish.\n\n
