SUMMARY:Teen Art Club @ South Regional Library
DESCRIPTION:For creatives in grades 6-12:\n\nJoin us for casual creativity 
 sessions with other artists at the South Regional Library! Meetings will 
 have an easy-to-learn art project planned (and coloring sheets at the 
 ready)\, but feel free to bring your sketchbook or current creative 
 project! You also have the option to do an art project of your own choosing 
