SUMMARY:Main's Teen Gaming Area
DESCRIPTION:Join the Librarians in the Teen Gaming Area! Come solo or bring 
 your friends! Play various titles for the PlayStation 5 and Nintendo 
 Switch. For Tweens & Teens in Grades 6th – 12th.\n\nPlease Note: Tweens 
 in 5th grade can use the gaming area only if they are accompanied in the 
 area with an adult age 18 and over.\n \n
LOCATION:Main Library - Teen Gaming Area\, Main Library (300 N. Roxboro St)
ORGANIZER;CN="LaShaunda Rogers":MAILTO:lrogers@dconc.gov
