SUMMARY:Crafternoon with the Bookmobile @ The Scrap Exchange
DESCRIPTION:Let's get creative! Join the bookmobile at the scrap exchange 
 for some crafting fun. We will use items from the blue barrels to create 
 things like cat toys\, boats\, mosaic art or whatever your can imagine. 
 \n\nSee you at the Scrap Exchange meet us in the Make N' Take room. No 
 registration required!\n\n* All Ages Welcomes!\n\nThe Scrap Exchange ~ 2050 
 Chapel Hill Rd\, Durham\, 27707\n\nThe Bookmobile will be at the Scrap 
 Exchange on the following Saturdays:\n\n\n	Saturday\, November 
 14th\n	Saturday\, December 5th\n\n\nInformation about our Bookmobile: 
 \n\nOur library-on-wheels serves local neighborhoods\, shopping centers\, 
 and other community locations. We're open to all so check out our schedule 
 to visit any of our many stops throughout Durham County. We have titles for 
 children\, teens\, and adults\, in both English and Spanish. See our full 
 bookmobile schedule here. \n\n*This schedule is subject to change without 
 notice due to weather\, traffic\, or mechanical difficulties.
