SUMMARY:ESOL Intermediate Level Class
DESCRIPTION:***MAIN LIBRARY REGISTRATION IS CLOSED*** Students should take 
 placement test with the Durham Literacy Center before attending classes. 
 Classes will start on Wednesday\, September 9 with the semester ending on 
 Wednesday\, December 9. Classes will be held on Monday & Wednesday from 
 10:00 a.m. - 12:00 p.m. in Conference Room #3214 at Main Library. If you 
 would like more information about the registration process or have 
 questions\, please email ESOL@durhamliteracy.org or call the ESOL Program 
 by phone at (919) 489-8383\, ext. 25. \n
