SUMMARY:ABC Storytime with Ms. Donielle
DESCRIPTION:Please join Ms. Donielle's storytime where everyone will learn 
 their ABCs! During each session\, we will all practice sounding out a 
 letter along with words that begin with that letter. There will also be 
 stories\, songs\, movement\, and more!\n\nAfter storytime\, we will have a 
 30-minute playtime session beginning at 11:00am. \n\nThis program is for 
 children (0-5 years) and their caregivers. Registration is appreciated. \n
