SUMMARY:Mini Makers Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Come craft with Ms.Chelsea on Mondays! We will create and laugh 
 the morning away here at North Regional!\n\nRegistration is Required! 
 Please register only the child who will be participating in the craft! If 
 more than one child\, please register EACH child!\n\nThis program will be 
 held on October 26\, 2026\, at 10:30 a.m. at North Regional Library. The 
 address is 221 Milton Rd. Durham\, NC 27712. \n\nIf you have any 
 accessibility questions or accommodation needs\, please contact us at 
 cromero@dconc.gov. We ask that all requests be made at least three (3) 
 business days prior to the event to ensure we can provide the best 
 accommodations possible!
