SUMMARY:Explore Your Water with Durham's Department of Water Management!
DESCRIPTION:Have your ever wondered where your water comes from\, or how it 
 gets to you? Erin from the Durham Department of Water Management will teach 
 us about water conservation and we'll explore the Enviroscape which is the 
 small-scale model of drinking water and wastewater treatment. \n\nThis 
 program is geared towards elementary aged children. Registration is 
 appreciated\, but not required. Questions? Please email Kristen at 
 kstockdale@dconc.gov or call (919) 560-8592. \n\n \n\nIf you have questions 
 about accessibility\, program stimulation levels\, and/or need disability 
 accommodations\, please contact us at (919) 560-8592.
