SUMMARY:Page & Pen Writing Roundtable
DESCRIPTION:A smaller\, discussion-based weekday session of the Page and 
 Pen Writing Workshop. This will be one hour of open-format conversation 
 about any aspect of creative writing. Topcs are up to you! Generating 
 ideas\, drafting\, sketching\, outlining\, actual writing\, editing\, 
 polishing\, workshopping\, submitting\, publishing -- any of that. We'll 
 also brainstorm any topics you'd like to see covered in our main Saturday 
 workshop sessions. Newcomers welcome!\n\nE-mail Bob with any questions: 
 rskesler@dconc.gov
