SUMMARY:Spookfest! Book Tasting
DESCRIPTION:Hungry for a little business inspiration? Pull up a chair and 
 sample a variety of books covering entrepreneurship\, marketing\, money\, 
 leadership\, creativity\, and personal growth.\n\nJust like a food 
 tasting\, you'll get a chance to “sample” several books without 
 committing to the whole thing. Explore short excerpts\, discover new 
 ideas\, share your thoughts\, and find the book\, or big idea\, you want to 
 take home with you.\n\nWhether you're a current business owner\, aspiring 
 entrepreneur\, side hustler\, creative\, or simply curious about business\, 
 there's something on the menu for you.
