SUMMARY:Kids Voting at North Regional Library
DESCRIPTION:Kids Voting Durham is offering the opportunity for K-12 
 students to vote on the same candidates as adults in this election season! 
 \n\nYouth under 18 are invited to stop by to cast their ballot starting 
 Thursday\, October 15th.\n\nLearn about the elections and let your voice be 
 heard! Voting booth is located in the Children's Area at North Regional 
 Library. \n\nQuestions? Please reach out to Molly at mschaefer@dconc.gov or 
 call 919-560-0234.
LOCATION:North Regional Library (221 Milton Rd)
ORGANIZER;CN="Molly Schaefer":MAILTO:mschaefer@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Announcements
UID:LibCal-14288-17838661
URL:https://durhamcountylibrary.libcal.com/event/17838661
END:VEVENT
