 in this month's Maker   STEAM Take and Make! Paint a laser-cut wooden 
 bookmark\, enjoy a warm beverage\, and peruse several reading resources 
 with this kit for you to take home.\n\nKits are located in the shelving 
 unit outside of the Innovation Lab on the Third Floor at Main Library for 
