SUMMARY:Preschool STEAM Storytime: Let's Learn About Trains!
DESCRIPTION:Preschoolers (ages 3-5 years) and their caregivers are welcome 
 to join Ms. Natalie for a STEAM (Science\, Technology\, Engineering\, 
 Arts\, and Mathematics) storytime! On the 1st and 3rd Monday of every 
 month\, we will explore a different STEAM topic with stories\, songs\, and 
 a hands-on activity.\n\nThis week\, we will learn all about trains and 
 create our own paper trains using cardstock paper\, markers\, cotton 
 balls\, and glue!\n\nRegistration is required.\n\nIf you have questions 
 about accessibility\, program stimulation levels\, and/or need disability 
